# 0157 WIP: N1a shared Ruby HAL (MMIO + pwrap read).
# Moves the duplicated pwrap read/wait path out of ruby_keys into ruby_hal;
# keys behavior is unchanged.  No rail/PMIC/clock/WDT writes are added.
# The later N1b will migrate the duplicated I2C bit-bang/battery path.
#
# KERNEL_EXPECT_EXEC_DATA stays empty until the device gate
# (keys + battery + touch regression) passes.
